    {
      "id": "msg.day3.lunch-order",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "11:43",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "archiveBatchId": "batch.day03.archive",
        "archivedCount": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        "有人要訂午餐嗎？七樓今天又不收外送。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.lunch-yesterday",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
      "time": "11:44",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "archiveBatchId": "batch.day03.archive",
        "archivedCount": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        "妳昨天才說那家很難吃。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.lunch-hungry",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "11:44",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "archiveBatchId": "batch.day03.archive",
        "archivedCount": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        "昨天的我沒有今天這麼餓。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.lunch-ask-player",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "11:45",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "archiveBatchId": "batch.day03.archive",
        "archivedCount": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        "你中午要不要一起訂？我差一份免運。"
      ],
      "replyPrompt": {
        "id": "prompt.day3.lunch-plan",
        "availableThrough": "day.03",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "join",
            "text": "都可以，我跟你們一起。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.join-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:46",
                "lines": [
                  "好，我先幫你點不辣的。不要香菜的現在說。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.join-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:47",
                "lines": [
                  "我的不要。婉庭，上次妳說有記住。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ask-floor",
            "text": "七樓為什麼不收外送？",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.floor-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:46",
                "lines": [
                  "警衛說今天那邊在清點，先放一樓。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.floor-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:47",
                "lines": [
                  "那我先下去拿。再放下去湯都涼了。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "brought-own",
            "text": "我自己帶了。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.own-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:46",
                "lines": [
                  "好。下次要訂再跟我說，我每天都在湊免運。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.return-code-audit",
      "channelId": "channel.dm.lin-yuan",
      "actorId": "actor.lin-yuan",
      "time": "09:32",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [
        "cond.return.notified.day1-code-audit"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "窗口剛把文件退回來了，人員編號跟原表對不上。你昨天核對時怎麼還是放行了？",
        "退件明天會回到你的待辦，原表跟送件紀錄都附在裡面。這次請逐筆看過再送。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.m1-find-version",
      "channelId": "channel.dm.lin-yuan",
      "actorId": "actor.lin-yuan",
      "time": "10:12",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "caseOpened": "case.day3.h204"
      },
      "lines": [
        "送之前還有哪裡不清楚？"
      ],
      "replyPrompt": {
        "id": "prompt.day3.m1-find-version",
        "availableThrough": "day.03",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ask-receipt",
            "text": "補件已收件，是指編號確認好了嗎？",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.m1-reply-find-version-ask-receipt",
                "actorId": "actor.lin-yuan",
                "time": "10:13",
                "lines": [
                  "不是，收件只表示窗口拿到補件。編號還得等他們回。你可以先選一份送，也可以留待查，依據要能找回來。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "know-location",
            "text": "我先把兩份留著，有回覆再看。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.m1-reply-find-version-know-location",
                "actorId": "actor.lin-yuan",
                "time": "10:13",
                "lines": [
                  "好，別只存最後一份。我上次就是找不到舊版，重問了半天。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
